      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Так, стоять.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold it right there.' Barinov commands attention, stopping the interaction instantly.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "В чём дело?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is the matter?' Elena demands to know the reason for his sudden interruption.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вы украли наше блюдо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You stole our dish.' Barinov makes a blunt accusation of theft regarding the recipe.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Мы его сами придумали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We invented it ourselves.' Elena fires back, firmly claiming originality.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я так и знал.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I knew it.' Barinov expresses his lack of surprise at the situation.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вы ничего не можете сами.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You cannot do anything yourselves.' He insults their competence, insisting they rely on stealing ideas.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Посмотрите на эту дату.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look at this date.' Elena presents evidence to counter his claim, drawing attention to a specific detail.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну, ну.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, well.' Barinov reacts with slight hesitation as he takes in the new information.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "elena",
      "t": "Дайте мне меню, пожалуйста.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give me the menu, please.' Elena confidently asks for the item back, knowing she has the upper hand.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
